cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying paper."
title: "PyZebArdYolo"
abstract: "Open-source, low-cost acquisition unit for real-time YOLO11 detection and position-contingent visual stimulation of adult zebrafish (Danio rerio). Couples a consumer webcam to an Arduino Uno R3 and runs offline on a standard laptop (Intel OpenVINO, no dedicated GPU)."
